{
  "description": "Mobile 390x844 portrait, DPR 3, touch, R-53: Paste of a self-authored plain text. Runs after 87, with A on the canvas and nothing selected. Grants clipboard read and write to the reference origin only, writes the self-authored plain text \"Planewright plain text\" to the clipboard and reads its shape back. Then picks Paste from the canvas menu of a right click on empty canvas at (300,380), a mouse event on the touch-emulated page, reading the scene and the app state and saving a capture, and presses Undo, Redo and Undo, reading after each. It types nothing, writes no link and follows no link.",
